{'symbol': 'FRT', 'date': '2022-10-11 07:15:00', 'title': 'FEDERAL REALTY ANNOUNCES SETTING OF SCIENCE-BASED GHG REDUCTION TARGETS', 'text': 'PART OF OVERALL STRATEGY FOR MANAGING TRANSITIONAL AND PHYSICAL CLIMATE RISKS AND\xa0 ACHIEVING OPERATIONAL NET ZERO EMISSIONS NORTH BETHESDA, MD. , OCT. 11, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0FEDERAL REALTY INVESTMENT TRUST (NYSE: FRT) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS SET A TARGET APPROVED BY THE SCIENCE BASED TARGETS INITIATIVE TO REDUCE SCOPE 1 AND 2 GREENHOUSE GAS EMISSIONS BY 46% BETWEEN 2019 AND 2030.'}